# Product S3 ownership

Live site is S3/CloudFront. Folders `tropical_forcing/`, `polar_vortex/`, `subseasonal/`, and `seasonal/` are published from the **misc** repo (`misc/<product>/site/index.html` + Action outputs).

Never full-seed or `aws s3 sync` those prefixes from this repo. `misc/site_publish/seed_site.sh` excludes them — keep that. For product HTML/toggle/controls changes, edit misc and publish with `--s3`.
